<turbo-frame data-js-modal>
  <sdoc-backdrop>
    <sdoc-modal>
      <sdoc-modal-container data-testid="tree-map-html-tips-content">
        <h3>Tree map tips</h3>

        {# <p>Click a folder to open it. The rows above the map show its parents. Click any row to move up to that level.</p> #}
        <p>The breadcrumb records the nodes you visited.
        <br>Use the backspace icon {% include "icons/ico16_backspace.svg" %}  to return to the previous view.</p>
        <p>Large folders are split into groups. Use the controls beside the item range to move between them.</p>

        <p><b>Keyboard shortcuts</b></p>
        <p>Move the pointer over the tree map area to use these shortcuts for that map:</p>
        <ul class="tree-map-html-tips__shortcuts">
          <li>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key">{% include "icons/ico16_backspace.svg" %}</kbd>
            return to the previous view.
          </li>
          <li>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key">⏶</kbd>
            open the parent folder.
          </li>
          <li>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key">⏴</kbd>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key">⏵</kbd>
            move between groups.
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p>When a control or folder has keyboard focus:</p>
        <ul class="tree-map-html-tips__shortcuts">
          <li>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key tree-map-html-tips__key--text">Enter</kbd>
            or
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key tree-map-html-tips__key--text">Space</kbd>
            activates it.
          </li>
          <li>
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key tree-map-html-tips__key--text">Tab</kbd>
            moves to the next control;
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key tree-map-html-tips__key--text">Shift</kbd>
            +
            <kbd class="tree-map-html-tips__key tree-map-html-tips__key--text">Tab</kbd>
            moves to the previous one.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </sdoc-modal-container>
      {%- with cancel_name="Close" -%}
        {% include "components/button/cancel.jinja" %}
      {%- endwith -%}
    </sdoc-modal>
  </sdoc-backdrop>
</turbo-frame>
